---
title: Kneeling Wide-Grip Push-Ups
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![отжимания на коленях с широкой постановкой рук](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e1bcb6c-4a90-4a14-9fa4-513218cc6da1)


{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Place your hands on the floor slightly wider than shoulder-width.

### Step 2
Get into a modified push-up position, supporting your body on your hands and knees.

### Step 3
Lower your body down until your chest is just above the floor.

### Step 4
Push through your hands to press yourself back up, extending your arms without locking your elbows.
{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Keep your movements slow and controlled throughout the exercise.

• Keep your body in a straight line from your head through your hips to your knees.

• Keep your shoulders pulled down away from your ears rather than shrugging them up.
{{< /callout >}}
